\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf1 The Bird Buddy Smart Bird Feeder Pro was a breeze to set up and connect to its companion app, thanks to a straightforward instruction manual and intuitive app prompts. Once I filled it with the best bird seed and hung it from a tree in my backyard, its well-designed perch quickly attracted a variety of species. Despite its relatively small size, the perch accommodated several birds at once.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf1 The Bird Buddy app did a fantastic job of presenting curated "postcards" on the main dashboard, showcasing only the clearest, best-quality images. Although its 122-degree field of view was slightly narrower than other models I tested, the impressive 2K video quality more than made up for it. The sharp focus and high frame rate let me to observe the small details and personalities of these curious little creatures, from their search for specific seeds in the tray to subtle head movements as they interacted with each other.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf1 The AI identification wasn't always accurate. It sometimes identified birds based on partial images, and I couldn't confirm them with the Cornell Lab of Ornithology's Merlin Bird ID Wizard App. Still, its accuracy was on par with other smart feeders I tested. All of the Bird Buddy app's features are available without a subscription, but the Premium plan ($6 monthly or $60 annually) offers 2K Ultra image resolution, access to remote feeders from around the globe, and unlimited cloud storage. I tested the 2K Ultra setting, but didn't see much of a difference from the 2K setting.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf1 I encountered only a few issues. The small, awkwardly placed filling hatch made it tricky to fill without spilling seed, even with the included seed pourer. The metal hanger was also slightly too thick for the mounting holes, so I had to force it through the holes. I initially had trouble connecting to the live camera feed and receiving postcards, but customer service was helpful. They advised me to reset the camera and download an update, and everything started working smoothly.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
